                        "entry_id": "86c85698-644d-3b85-9972-44e9ee4262f0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A woman who runs a business in custom-made fashion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "36795d00-606e-48a8-b36b-e65b2bb1faef",
                                "sense_id": "7eff59df-7f8f-3192-a47b-9f766103c431",
                                "text": "Considering the enormous cost of the gowns, which the countess had insisted Leah needed, she imagined the couturière’s fees for such work would be equally as hefty."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a526d73-9b45-44bc-93c1-2ebe9e2ea25b",
                                "sense_id": "7eff59df-7f8f-3192-a47b-9f766103c431",
                                "text": "Many of Chanel’s biographers give the impression that she became a couturière by chance or whim, whereas in fact she had strong business sense and the backing of an intelligent, influential partner in Boy Capel."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "92280180-929f-48dc-ad29-9df0d6cbab90",
                                "sense_id": "7eff59df-7f8f-3192-a47b-9f766103c431",
                                "text": "A positive note today was a visit by Aunt Emily’s couturière to measure me for some ‘appropriately fashionable gowns’ as if we Americans have no idea of fashion or style."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5dfe057d-0809-4064-b645-2b01760fef81",
                                "sense_id": "7eff59df-7f8f-3192-a47b-9f766103c431",
                                "text": "In just moments a skirt is conceived, designed and crafted as the couturière constructs the garment “in any way that might strike her fancy.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0c7f8e06-005c-47ec-b04e-7c7443c68ebe",
                                "sense_id": "7eff59df-7f8f-3192-a47b-9f766103c431",
                                "text": "In her early years she [Coco Chanel] wanted to sing on stage, rather than to become a couturière."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
